## Request

Add the smallest repository-neutral terminal reconciliation route for campaigns whose execution is
fully terminal but whose lifecycle remains running because stale assignments still project as
pending. Reuse the existing campaign lifecycle, assignment, audit, API, dashboard, queue, and
prepare/apply mechanisms. Keep outcome satisfaction separate from administrative closure.

The plan must classify every pending assignment. Apply must recheck the exact project and state,
prove there is no runnable or nonterminal run or operation, retire only assignments proven stale
or non-runnable by the documented rule, preserve all history, record the explicit terminal
disposition and reason, and close atomically. New runnable work or an unclassified assignment must
fail without partial mutation.

Stop after focused implementation proof, strict Doctor, configured development-lane verification,
the exact Work2 candidate registration, and a durable Hybrid checkpoint. Do not publish, tag,
release, close GitHub issues, or begin M3 in this campaign.

